---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
    title="Changelog — PixlPut"
    description="Release notes for PixlPut."
    path="/changelog"
>
    <section class="prose container">
        <h1>Changelog</h1>

        <article>
            <h2>1.1 — Launch</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Restore after a restart: PixlPut waits for your apps to relaunch, then puts every window back on its Desktop and position.</li>
                <li>Layouts follow their Desktop. Adding, removing or reordering Desktops no longer applies a layout to the wrong one.</li>
                <li>Restores windows on every Desktop, not just the one on screen.</li>
                <li>Browser windows on other Desktops are matched by their active tab.</li>
                <li>Finder is left alone. macOS already reopens Finder windows where they were.</li>
                <li>Popups and panels are no longer saved as windows.</li>
                <li>Capture always saves the Desktop you clicked it on.</li>
                <li>Much faster window scanning.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .prose { padding: 64px 0; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .prose h1 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .prose article { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .prose h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .prose ul { padding-left: 24px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.65; }
</style>
